        {
            "id": "a003_446_0000",
            "en_US": [
                "Oh, Shaymin!{VAR BE01}\n",
                "When it comes to Shaymin,\n",
                "Gracidea flowers are important!{VAR BE01}\n",
                "I have a lot of Gracidea flowers,\n",
                "so let me share one with you.{VAR BE01}"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_446_0001",
            "en_US": [
                "Since early times in Sinnoh, people\n",
                "made a bouquet of Gracidea flowers{VAR BE00}\n",
                "to give someone to show their{VAR BE00}\n",
                "feelings of appreciation.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Isn't that interesting?{VAR BE01}\n",
                "By giving a Gracidea bouquet,\n",
                "you don't have to say a word, and{VAR BE00}\n",
                "someone will know how grateful you are.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Quite a delightful custom!"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_446_0002",
            "en_US": [
                "Do you know about Gracidea flowers?{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Since early times in Sinnoh, people\n",
                "made a bouquet of Gracidea flowers{VAR BE00}\n",
                "to give someone to show their{VAR BE00}\n",
                "feelings of appreciation."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_446_0003",
            "en_US": [
                "Every Gym Badge tells the story\n",
                "of a hard-won victory against{VAR BE00}\n",
                "a worthy opponent.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "I can look at a Gym Badge and\n",
                "tell you that story.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Can I see one of your Gym Badges?"
            ]
        },
        {
